INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('482','8','10','<p>My Favorite TeacherMy favorite teacher is Ms. Suntea. She teaches English at my school. She is tall and has short black hair. She is always cheerful ,charm and patient with her students. Ms. Suntea often uses games and songs in the classroom, so learning English becomes fun for students. She always encourages us to speak English confidently. Many students like her because she is kind and helpful. I really admire her <strong>dedication</strong> to teaching.</p>\r\n<p>The word &ldquo;<strong>dedication</strong>&rdquo; means&hellip;</p>','1','<p>Carelessness</p>','<p>Commitment</p>','<p>Laziness</p>','<p>Failure</p>','<p>Dislike</p>','B','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('483','8','11','<p>My First Cooking Experience</p>\r\n<p>Last Sunday, I tried cooking for the first time. I wanted to make fried rice for my family. I prepared rice, eggs, vegetables, and soy sauce. At first, I didn&rsquo;t know how much oil to use, so the rice became a bit oily. But my mother helped me and told me to keep stirring it. After fifteen minutes, my fried rice was ready. My family said it was delicious. I felt proud and happy with my first cooking experience.</p>\r\n<p>When did the writer cook for the first time?</p>','1','<p>On Monday</p>','<p>On Saturday</p>','<p>On Sunday</p>','<p>On Friday</p>','<p>On Tuesday</p>','C','','','','','','','');
