INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('491','8','19','<p>My First Cooking Experience</p>\r\n<p>Last Sunday, I tried cooking for the first time. I wanted to make fried rice for my family. I prepared rice, eggs, vegetables, and soy sauce. At first, I didn&rsquo;t know how much oil to use, so the rice became a bit oily. But my mother helped me and told me to keep <strong>stirring</strong> it. After fifteen minutes, my fried rice was ready. My family said it was delicious. I felt proud and happy with my first cooking experience.</p>\r\n<p>The word &ldquo;<strong>stirring</strong>&rdquo; means&hellip;</p>','1','<p>Cutting</p>','<p>Pouring</p>','<p>Mixing by moving a spoon</p>','<p>Washing</p>','<p>Frying</p>','C','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('492','8','20','<p>My First Cooking Experience</p>\r\n<p>Last Sunday, I tried cooking for the first time. I wanted to make fried rice for my family. I prepared rice, eggs, vegetables, and soy sauce. At first, I didn&rsquo;t know how much oil to use, so the rice became a bit oily. But my mother helped me and told me to keep stirring it. After fifteen minutes, my fried rice was ready. My family said it was delicious. I felt proud and happy with my first cooking experience.</p>\r\n<p>What is the moral lesson from the story?</p>','1','<p>Always ask others to cook</p>','<p>Cooking is boring</p>','<p>Trying something new can be fun</p>','<p>Never help your parents</p>','<p>Avoid mistakes in life</p>','C','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('493','8','21','<p>The Ant and the Dove</p>\r\n<p>One day, an ant was drinking water from a river. Suddenly, it slipped and fell into the water. A dove sitting on a tree saw the ant struggling. The dove quickly dropped a leaf near the ant. The ant climbed onto the leaf and floated to the shore safely. A few days later, a hunter came to catch the dove. The ant bit the hunter&rsquo;s foot, and the dove flew away safely. The dove thanked the ant for saving her life.</p>\r\n<p>Questions: Where was the ant drinking water?</p>','1','<p>From a lake</p>','<p>From a river</p>','<p>From a pond</p>','<p>From a bottle</p>','<p>From a tap</p>','B','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('494','8','22','<p>The Ant and the Dove</p>\r\n<p>One day, an ant was drinking water from a river. Suddenly, it slipped and fell into the water. A dove sitting on a tree saw the ant struggling. The dove quickly dropped a leaf near the ant. The ant climbed onto the leaf and floated to the shore safely. A few days later, a hunter came to catch the dove. The ant bit the hunter&rsquo;s foot, and the dove flew away safely. The dove thanked the ant for saving her life.</p>\r\n<p>Questions: What happened to the ant?</p>','1','<p>It fell into the water</p>','<p>It got lost</p>','<p>It ran away</p>','<p>It met a fish</p>','<p>It was eaten</p>','A','','','','','','','');
