INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('578','9','37','<p>Yummy Milkshake.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;Ingredients:</p>\r\n<p>- Chocolate ice cream.</p>\r\n<p>- 10 coconut biscuits</p>\r\n<p>- Milk</p>\r\n<p>Steps:</p>\r\n<p>First, put a few scoops of ice cream into the blender.</p>\r\n<p>After that, blend with enough milk to make the mixture thick, but fairly liquid.</p>\r\n<p>At last, add the remaining ingredients and blend</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>What is the generic structure of the text?</p>','1','<p>Goal- equipment- steps</p>','<p>Goal- materials- resolution</p>','<p>Goal- materials- steps</p>','<p>Goal- ingredients- resolution</p>','<p>Goal - resolution - steps</p>','C','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('579','9','38','<p>Most people agree that some type of family limitation or spacing is fascinating for the nice of the family and society. However people and groups&ndash; particularly spiritual groups&ndash;differ sharply on the ways of contraception that they contemplate as ethical and acceptable.</p>\r\n<p>Couples that apply contraception do this for numerous reasons. They&rsquo;ll wish to limit or area their youngsters or to own no youngsters the least bit. Young couples usually delay having youngsters in order that each partner will work regularly. Different couples area their youngsters so that they will provide every kid the maximum amount of attention as potential.</p>\r\n<p>Some girls square measure suggested by their doctors to avoid gestation for health reasons. In several countries with chop-chop growing populations, the govt. encourages couples to limit the scale of their families. Although contraception has gained acceptance, opposition to the application is continuous.</p>\r\n<p>Some individuals concern that contraception encourages sexual relations out of wedlock or that government may impose contraception. Some spiritual teams oppose contraception on ethical grounds. Some spiritual teams teach that artificial ways of contraception square measure immoral as a result of they separate the 2 functions of intercourse in marriage&ndash;conjugal love and also the sex activity of youngsters. Though they oppose all artificial contraception, they contemplate natural birth control as acceptable</p>\r\n<p>What will the text discuss?</p>','1','<p>Family coming up with</p>','<p>The disagreement with contraception</p>','<p>Reason to support family limitation</p>','<p>The 2 completely different opinion on contraception</p>','<p>The spiritual cluster that disagrees with contraception</p>','D','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('580','9','39','<p>Most people agree that some type of family limitation or spacing is fascinating for the nice of the family and society. However people and groups&ndash; particularly spiritual groups&ndash;differ sharply on the ways of contraception that they contemplate as ethical and acceptable.</p>\r\n<p>Couples that apply contraception do this for numerous reasons. They&rsquo;ll wish to limit or area their youngsters or to own no youngsters the least bit. Young couples usually delay having youngsters in order that each partner will work regularly. Different couples area their youngsters so that they will provide every kid the maximum amount of attention as potential.</p>\r\n<p>Some girls square measure suggested by their doctors to avoid gestation for health reasons. In several countries with chop-chop growing populations, the govt. encourages couples to limit the scale of their families. Although contraception has gained acceptance, opposition to the application is continuous.</p>\r\n<p>Some individuals concern that contraception encourages sexual relations out of wedlock or that government may impose contraception. Some spiritual teams oppose contraception on ethical grounds. Some spiritual teams teach that artificial ways of contraception square measure immoral as a result of they separate the 2 functions of intercourse in marriage&ndash;conjugal love and also the sex activity of youngsters. Though they oppose all artificial contraception, they contemplate natural birth control as acceptable</p>\r\n<p>Why don&rsquo;t they support birth control?</p>','1','<p>To limit the family size</p>','<p>To area the kids&rsquo; birth.</p>','<p>To avoid a high family budget.</p>','<p>To avoid a risk-health gestation</p>','<p>To share abundant attention with the kids.</p>','C','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('581','9','40','<p>Most people agree that some type of family limitation or spacing is fascinating for the nice of the family and society. However people and groups&ndash; particularly spiritual groups&ndash;differ sharply on the ways of contraception that they contemplate as ethical and acceptable.</p>\r\n<p>Couples that apply contraception do this for numerous reasons. They&rsquo;ll wish to limit or area their youngsters or to own no youngsters the least bit. Young couples usually <strong>delay</strong> having youngsters in order that each partner will work regularly. Different couples area their youngsters so that they will provide every kid the maximum amount of attention as potential.</p>\r\n<p>Some girls square measure suggested by their doctors to avoid gestation for health reasons. In several countries with chop-chop growing populations, the govt. encourages couples to limit the scale of their families. Although contraception has gained acceptance, opposition to the application is continuous.</p>\r\n<p>Some individuals concern that contraception encourages sexual relations out of wedlock or that government may impose contraception. Some spiritual teams oppose contraception on ethical grounds. Some spiritual teams teach that artificial ways of contraception square measure immoral as a result of they separate the 2 functions of intercourse in marriage&ndash;conjugal love and also the sex activity of youngsters. Though they oppose all artificial contraception, they contemplate natural birth control as acceptable</p>\r\n<p>Young couples usually delay having youngsters &hellip;.(par.2) <strong>The delay</strong>&nbsp;word means that</p>','1','<p>Suspect</p>','<p>Suspend</p>','<p>&nbsp;Respect</p>','<p>&nbsp;Direct</p>','<p>Recall</p>','B','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('582','9','31','<p>Guide to Using a Computer for a beginner&rsquo;s</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Power On: Locate the power button on your computer\'s case or monitor. Press it to turn on the computer.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Using the Mouse:</strong> Left-click to select items, right-click to open a context menu, and drag and drop to move items.</li>\r\n<li>Login: If prompted, enter your username and password to access your user account.</li>\r\n<li>Desktop: The desktop is the main screen where you interact with your computer.</li>\r\n<li>Icons: These are shortcuts to applications, files, and folders. Double-click an icon to open the corresponding item.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; How do you open an application?</p>','1','<p>Press the power button</p>','<p>Right-click on the application\'s icon</p>','<p>Left-click on the application\'s icon</p>','<p>Double-click the application\'s icon</p>','<p>Drag and drop the application\'s icon drop the application\'s icon</p>','D','','','','','','','');
